<title>USA: Avondale Finl to buy back 10 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>Avondale Finl to buy back 10 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avondale Financial Corp said Friday it intended to repurchase up to 10 percent of its outstanding common shares in the open market over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>At July 31, the holding company for Avondale Federal Savings Bank had 3,814,568 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
